@Flashcards.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5074

### List all decks (ordered by name)
GET {{Flashcards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/decks
Accept: application/json

###

### Get one deck with all cards
GET {{Flashcards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/decks/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get card count for a deck
GET {{Flashcards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/decks/1/count
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a deck
POST {{Flashcards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/decks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "French basics"
}

###

### Create a card in a deck
POST {{Flashcards.Api_HostAddress}}/api/decks/1/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetWord": "bonjour",
  "sentence": "Bonjour tout le monde.",
  "translation": "hello",
  "definitions": "A common greeting."
}

###
